Use if inside your loop to make different rooms behave differently:

for i in range(1, 6):
    if i == 3:
        print("Trap! Lose 10 HP.")
    elif i == 5:
        print("Final boss!")
    else:
        print("Safe room.")

You can also keep a score variable and update it inside the loop:

score = 0
for i in range(1, 6):
    score = score + 10
    print("Score:", score)
